  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When making the colliders smaller to fit the fingers, in game they noticeably longer and extend farther than the custom length.\nIf the colliders are made longer, however, they retain their custom length in game.\nBoth the avatars I tested it on had only the thumb, index, middle, and pinky. all with two segments and a very small third distal bone on the end.\nAside the unusual setup of the fingers for my avatars, other users have discussed this issue on the discord as well.\nSDK version- VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2022.04.21.03.29_Public",
